@startuml
[*] --> Running: Power On
Shutdown --> Running: Power On
Running --> Configuration: Configuration Request
Configuration --> Running: Configuration Complete
Running --> Running: Clock Tick
Running --> Running: Summary Request
Running --> Running: Status Request
Running --> Running: Activity Complete
Running --> Controlled: Remote Control
Running --> Shutdown: Shutdown Command
Controlled --> [*]: Shutdown Command
Shutdown --> [*]
@enduml
